{"tool": "escalate", "args": {"reason": "Worker-X revocation prevents final CRM updates. Refund issued (45) for C-1730, but cannot document corrected ship_site (Austin DC) or attach evidence of Rotterdam DC-TOAR error without worker-X. Escalation required for ticket closure per platform policy."}}
